  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beside Bull Demon, Fairy Zi Wei names Flower Lady when Longevity Heaven sends the pair at her. Narration describes a little girl with a flower on her head who sits on the muscular man’s shoulder, giggling with crystal-like eyes that flicker with innocence, while both hold rank eight cultivation. Together they force Zi Wei back with explosive exchanges.",
      "chapters": [
        1583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a little girl with a flower on her head. She sits on Bull Demon’s shoulder, giggles, and has crystal-like eyes that flicker with innocence.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Bull Demon share the North Desolation Immortal post among Longevity Heaven’s Four Desolation Immortals. When Bing Sai Chuan awakens, she giggles that West Desolation Immortal Bing Sai Chuan has awakened, and both greet him.",
      "chapters": [
        1692
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shared-desolation-immortal-post",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_north_desolation_immortal",
        "fac_four_desolations",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "char_west_desolation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She chuckles that Heavenly Court is three million years old from the Remote Antiquity Era and remains the number one force despite damaged fate Gu. She reads Heavenly Court’s golden pearls and delayed appearance of Zi Wei and Duke Long as stalling for fate Gu repair, then rides on Bull Demon’s shoulder into Sun Palace without showing nervousness.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inside-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "evt_era_remote",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_duke_long",
        "loc_sun_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After she has died earlier in the Heavenly Court battle, a flower lands in Heaven Overseeing Tower and turns into a little girl: Flower Lady revived. Narration states that she and Bull Demon share lifespan, so if one dies while the other lives, revival follows after some time. She enters the tower toward fate Gu while Bull Demon and Five Elements Grandmaster hold Che Wei and Cong Yan outside.",
      "chapters": [
        1720
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "revival",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "char_che_wei",
        "char_cong_yan"
      ]
    }
